    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin adds Responsive Mobile Menu functionality to WordPress.<br />\nLR Responsive Slide Menu has multi level menu support.<br />\nCross browser Compatible.<br />\nCombine multiple menus.<br />\nFor more features Please contact us at <a href=\"https://logicrays.com/contact-us.php\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\">Logicrays</a></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>lr-responsive-slide-menu</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n<li>Place <code>&lt;?php echo do_shortcode( '[responsiveslidemenu]' ); ?&gt;</code> in your header.php</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release with local Font Awesome assets and WordPress coding standards fixes.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Create Simple Responsive Slide Menu For Mobile, Use shortcode [responsiveslidemenu] in header.php",
